# Pairs with IntentOnlyForCompleteSplit. The root records a link intent without
# holding a completed split result.
MODULE: IntentOnlyForCompleteSplitEagerRecord
TARGET: IntentOnlyForCompleteSplit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a link intent is recorded for a split that is not complete
PERTURBS: RecordPending

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "done" /\ held /\ ~pending /\ ~linked
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no completed result required.
    /\ ~pending /\ ~linked
--- END
